# Jordan's job search

Two people in my network are helping: Mark, who I worked with at Northline and who is now at Solaris Energy, and Hannah, an old friend who leads a PMO team. I check in with each of them once a month.

Every conversation goes in one log: who I spoke to, which company or agent it was about, what came of it, and what to do next. By the second week, Northwind Power had turned me down, and Tidal Works wanted a screening call.

Then Dev at Apex offered to put me forward for a role at Tidal Works. I checked the company first: GreenTalent already represents me there, so I said no. Two agencies sending my CV to the same company could get me turned down there for a long time.

